  "term": "sexual drive",
  "definition": "Sexual drive is described here as one of the body’s basic physiological motivational systems. In this account, it is regulated by brain regions such as the nucleus accumbens and lateral hypothalamus, together with neurotransmitter and β-endorphin activity.",
